WEBVTT - Spider-Man: Brand New Day (Authentic Release)

1
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
J. JONAH JAMESON: We come to you now with a revelation of shocking, unprecedented proportions.

2
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.000
J. JONAH JAMESON: That's right, folks! The video you are about to see was captured right before Mysterio's death.

3
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.500
MYSTERIO: Spider-Man attacked me for reasons I couldn't explain...

4
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.200
MYSTERIO: ...he has an army of weaponized Stark drones!

5
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.200
J. JONAH JAMESON: But wait, there is more!

6
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.800
MYSTERIO: Spider-Man's... Spider-Man's real name is...

7
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.500
MYSTERIO: Spider-Man's real name is Peter Parker!

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.200
[Pedestrians gasping and murmuring in shock]

9
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.500
PETER PARKER: What the...?!

10
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.200
MJ: Peter?! What is happening?!

11
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.500
PEDESTRIAN: It's him! He's right there! Get him!

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.500
PETER PARKER: MJ, hold on to me! Hold on tight!

13
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.500
[Web shooter activates - THWIP!]

14
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.800
[Peter swings up between Manhattan buildings carrying MJ]

15
00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.000
MJ: Peter! Peter, where are we going?!

16
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.500
PETER PARKER: I don't know! Just don't look down!

17
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
[News helicopters buzzing overhead with spotlights flashing]

18
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:34.500
NEWS CHOPPER: We have visual on Spider-Man heading uptown over 6th Avenue!

19
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:39.000
PETER PARKER: I need to call Happy! I gotta call Aunt May!

20
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.500
MJ: My phone is blowing up! Everyone in the world knows who you are!

21
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.000
PETER PARKER: Okay, okay... stay calm. We're gonna find a place to land!

22
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.000
[Peter dives down onto the bridge cables]

23
00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.500
PETER PARKER: Are you okay? Are you hurt?

24
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.500
MJ: Am I okay?! Peter, your life just ended on national television!

25
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.500
PETER PARKER: No, no... Mr. Stark said... wait, Mr. Stark isn't here.

26
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:13.000
PETER PARKER: We need to get to my apartment. May is alone there!

27
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.000
[Police sirens wail across the bridge as cars honk frantically]

28
00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:23.000
PETER PARKER: Hang on, we're going underground!

29
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:28.000
[Peter swings down through the subway grating into the tunnel]

30
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:34.000
SUBWAY CONDUCTOR: Hey! What is going on down here?!

31
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:40.000
PETER PARKER: Sorry! Just taking the train!
